<h1>Sunday Liquor Questions</h1>
<p>These questions are precinct-specific. The guide is rechecking their exact November wording and precinct assignments because the previously linked BOE PDF is for the May primary. Treat the entries below as pending until you confirm them on your own ballot.</p>
<p><a href="https://lookup.boe.ohio.gov/vtrapp/ashtabula/ballotlist.aspx">Open the official November sample ballot selector</a> and choose your precinct. The <a href="https://www.ohiosos.gov/assets/2026-11-general-qandi.xlsx">Ohio Secretary of State local issues workbook</a> is also available.</p>

